 📉 The dashboard: The S&amp;P 500 closed down 1.2%.

 AI stocks slipped on fresh concerns for the level of debt needed to fund infrastructure investments, triggered in part by Meta's capex plans . 🥶 Today's stock spotlight: Moderna (-17.6%) plummeted after leaked trial data for a melanoma vaccine developed with Merck fell short of investor expectations.

 
 
